{
  "id": "stats-heatmap-retention-local",
  "title": "getStatsHeatmap and getStatsRetention from review_log in the replica (C-31)",
  "covers": [
    "stats.heatmap_local",
    "stats.retention_local"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "Two kana-only words. All seeded reviews carry utc_offset_min 0 and are logged at 10:00 UTC, far from any day boundary.",
    "2026-11-11: both cards introduced with Easy (two learning rows). 2026-11-17: card 1 scheduled Good, card 2 scheduled Again, then its relearning step Good (learning row). 2026-11-19: card 1 scheduled Good, undone one second later; then a manual set_due row.",
    "Step 0: the heatmap has two days: 11-11 with 2 reviews (2 new cards) and 11-17 with 3 reviews (1 Again). 11-19 is absent: the undone row and the manual row do not count.",
    "Step 1: retention counts scheduled rows only (not learning, not manual, not undone): 2 in total, 1 passed, 0.5; one group vocab/meaning.",
    "Step 2: grouped by day there is one group (11-17).",
    "Step 3: a range without reviews answers an empty days list, not 404.",
    "Steps 4-6: from after to, and a range over 3660 days, are 422 on both sides.",
    "The golden pins the remaining members (time_ms, young/mature split, keys of the day group)."
  ],
